== Trivia ==
* This item can be considered a direct upgrade to {{i|Infamy}}, as the chances to deny projectile damage are equal, but Belly Jelly additionally works with contact damage, unlike Infamy.
* Belly Jelly is just the brand of jelly beans Jelly Belly'''®,''' but the words are flipped. Given the game's theme, this also might be a reference to the jelly spread on the belly before an ultrasound.
* The costume given by this item is identical to {{i|Bucket of Lard}} and {{i|Binge Eater}}.

